Rule 8 (If images is 4D, then shape[1] must be greater than 1, shape[2] must be greater than 1, and shape[3] must be greater than 1)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 4 then shape(v_1, 1) > 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 1
