Rule 12 (Images with shape (B,H,W,C) must have B, H, W, and C greater than 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 4 then shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 0
>>
